findings.detail:
Web enum: AvatarItemDetails, AvatarItemAffiliate, ContentPost, ExperienceInvite, ExperienceAffiliate, FriendInvite, NotificationExperienceInvite, Profile, ScreenshotInvite, Server, ExperienceDetails, ExperienceEvent.
Payload fields the web reads:
- experienceInviteData {status: Valid|Expired|InviterNotInExperience, placeId, instanceId, inviterId}. If Valid and instanceId is set, the web joins that instance (RequestGameJob placeId+gameId=instanceId, referredByPlayerId=inviterId). Otherwise it opens /games/{placeId}?experienceInviteLinkId=..&experienceInviteStatus=..
- notificationExperienceInviteData {status, placeId, instanceId, launchData, inviterId}. The web builds roblox://experiences/start?placeId=..&launchData=..&gameInstanceId=.. (only if Valid) &referredByPlayerId=..
- screenshotInviteData {status, placeId, launchData, instanceId}
- experienceDetailsInviteData {status: Invalid|Expired|Valid, universeId}. Plain join of the root place.
- experienceAffiliateData {status: Invalid|Valid, universeId, joinData{launchData, experienceEventId}, fallbackType 0/1/2 = INVALID/PROFILE/HOME, fallbackId}
- experienceEventData {status: Invalid|Valid, universeId, placeId, joinData}
- profileLinkResolutionResponseData {status: Valid|SenderBlockedRecipient|Invalid, userId}
Not game targets: friendInviteData {senderUserId}, avatarItemDetailsData {itemId, itemType}, contentPostData {postCreatorId, postId}.
